Package: r300ya
Title: R Interface to the Yandex Service for Retelling Texts with YandexGPT
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrey", "Kobzev", email = "kobzev.andrew@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-6641-3072"))
Description: Automatically generates a short description (retelling) of web
    pages with the 'YandexGPT' neural network via the <https://300.ya.ru>
    service. The user specifies the URL of a web page and gets back its title
    and a list of theses. For more information see the terms of use
    <https://yandex.ru/legal/300ya_termsofuse/>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
